<meta name="description" content="Lake Michigan College is a community college in southwest Michigan with 80 academic programs including associate degrees and certificates. Tuition at LMC is 1/3 that of the average university, making it an affordable option for your first two years before transferring. Live on campus in the Beckwith Hall dorms and your commute is as easy as walking to class." />
